   "source": [
    "The main customer variables do not all have the same shape. Income and total spending are quite spread out, and many customers spend a small amount while fewer customers spend a lot. Most customers have between 0 and 2 children. Recency is also spread out, so some customers bought recently and others have not bought for a while."
   ]
  },
